        64.59669494628906,
        527.5136108398438,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "(66) ethionamide, given for 6 months (6HRZEto)  . The recommendations in South Africa are based on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.992197036743164,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.1118774414062,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "expert opinion, in particular with regards to replacing ethambutol with a drug (ethionamide) that has",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995348930358887,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        90.99671936035156,
        527.392822265625,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "(65) more efficient blood-brain barrier penetration  . A clinical trial is underway to compare a regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.64990234375,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "consisting of higher-dose isoniazid, higher-dose rifampicin, pyrazinamide and levofloxacin given",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.448486328125,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "daily for 6 months, compared to the WHO-recommended regimen, but the results are not expected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.3880615234375,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "until 2023 (SURE trial, ISRCTN40829906). Shorter regimens may be as effective and safe, and may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4443359375,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "improve adherence and reduce the burden on persons with TBM and health care systems, but it is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.4540405273438,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "not known how outcomes compare between the shorter regimens and the WHO-recommended",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        160.1448974609375,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "12-month regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.51858520507812,
        524.2935180664062,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "PICO question:  In children and adolescents with presumed or bacteriologically confirmed drug-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.3882446289062,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "susceptible TB meningitis, should a 6-month intensive regimen, compared to the 12-month regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        269.5057067871094,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "that conforms to WHO guidelines be used?",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.62258911132812,
        527.445068359375,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "Evidence:  To inform recommendations on the treatment for child and adolescent TBM, a systematic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.4498291015625,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "review and meta-analysis was conducted to compare the effectiveness of shorter regimens versus",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.40460205078125,
        527.4699096679688,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "(8) the current WHO-recommended 12-month regimen  . The primary intervention of interest was the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.990145683288574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.6046142578125,
        527.4094848632812,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "(66) regimen currently used in South Africa  ; in secondary analyses, outcomes associated with other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        524.4281005859375,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "shorter regimens were examined. The search criteria from an earlier systematic review and meta-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        306.00457763671875,
        527.4417114257812,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "(64) analysis conducted in 2014 were updated and the search was run in February 2021  . Studies with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.999099731445312,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.5852661132812,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "available information on at least the composition and duration of treatment regimens were included.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997349739074707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.3881225585938,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "Ineligible regimens included those without rifampicin, treatment regimens with a duration over 12",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.1709594726562,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "months other than the WHO regimen, intermittent regimens and non-intensive short regimens. Pooled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949483871459961,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.1285400390625,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "proportions were estimated across studies and within regimens through aggregate-level meta-analysis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.955911636352539,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.489501953125,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "using GLMM with Gauss-Hermite quadrature for the following outcomes: death by end of treatment;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99644947052002,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.421142578125,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "loss to follow-up; treatment success; neurological sequelae (among survivors); and survival without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.4002075195312,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "neurological sequelae (among those starting treatment). Subgroup analyses were planned but were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        239.47412109375,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "not feasible, due to insufficient data.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.10260009765625,
        527.4525146484375,
        450.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "Of the 1820 unique citations screened, 149 full text papers were evaluated. Of these, five met inclusion",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966650009155273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.3025207519531,
        527.400390625,
        463.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "criteria for the systematic review. In addition, two unpublished cohorts were eligible for inclusion. In",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.7086181640625,
        527.4349365234375,
        476.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "(67–70) total, four studies of intervention regimens (three published and one unpublished)  , and three",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.991546630859375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        472.90850830078125,
        527.4317626953125,
        490.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "(71–73) studies of the comparator regimen (two published and one unpublished)   were identified. No",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.9026184082031,
        527.1337280273438,
        503.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "studies performing head-to-head comparisons of regimens were identified. Three of the four studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996048927307129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.10260009765625,
        527.438232421875,
        516.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "of intervention regimens were conducted in a single referral centre in South Africa. As only one study",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993348121643066,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        512.5084838867188,
        524.4317016601562,
        529.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "(69) reported on outcomes from an 8-month regimen in Vietnam  , it was excluded from the meta-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.5025634765625,
        527.44970703125,
        542.945556640625
      ],
      "text": "analysis. The two published studies of the comparator regimen were conducted at different sites in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        538.9085083007812,
        527.4744262695312,
        556.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "(71, 72) India  , while data for the unpublished study were collected in various centres in Europe through",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.973016738891602,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.1085815429688,
        527.4332885742188,
        569.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "(73) the Pediatric Tuberculosis Network European Trials Group (ptbnet)  . A total of 837 patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1026000976562,
        527.3632202148438,
        582.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "TBM received intervention regimens with the median age in each study ranging from 2.3 to 5.5 years",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99379825592041,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.302490234375,
        527.4410400390625,
        595.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "(age range: 2 months to 15 years). Among the 282 patients treated with the comparator regimen,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.5026245117188,
        527.4220581054688,
        608.9456176757812
      ],
      "text": "the median age in the European study was 3.3 years, while summary data on age were not reported",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.70263671875,
        186.7654266357422,
        622.1456298828125
      ],
      "text": "in the studies from India.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.406494140625,
        527.4190063476562,
        643.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "The cumulative number of deaths was recorded at the end of treatment for each regimen (i.e. at 6",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.6065063476562,
        527.1052856445312,
        657.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "months after treatment initiation in studies of the intervention regimen; at 12 months after treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995599746704102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.8065185546875,
        524.4039306640625,
        670.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "initiation in studies of the comparator regimen). Among studies of the intervention regimen, 0.0%–",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.0064697265625,
        527.400146484375,
        683.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "9.6% of patients died within six months; most deaths occurred early after hospital admission and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.20654296875,
        527.6007080078125,
        696.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "primarily involved patients diagnosed in stage 3 at baseline. Among studies of the comparator",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.406494140625,
        527.4190063476562,
        709.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "regimen (i.e. the standard of care), 7.1%–30.0% of patients died. In one of these studies, diagnosis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        708.6065063476562,
        527.443115234375,
        723.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "at stage 3 was most strongly associated with mortality, although stage-specific outcome data were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.8065185546875,
        527.4309692382812,
        736.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "not reported. In a random effects meta-analysis, the pooled proportions of deaths were 6.0% (95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        735.0065307617188,
        527.4112548828125,
        749.4495239257812
      ],
      "text": "confidence interval [CI] 2.0–13.0) and 24.0% (95% CI: 18.0–32.0) for children and adolescents who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        748.2064819335938,
        527.3926391601562,
        762.6494750976562
      ],
      "text": "received the intervention and comparator regimens, respectively. The percentage of patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
